{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439","id":3055234846,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc62Gy8e","number":9439,"title":"Agent will edit a file twice, fixing the issue twice, often making worse code than the first edit","user":{"login":"Cubox","id":479129,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTEyOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479129?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox","html_url":"https://github.com/Cubox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cubox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5405165354,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJYd5Dc8AAAABQixHKg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"8D6673","default":true,"description":"Issue identified by VS Code Team member as probable bug"},{"id":7700056454,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJYd5Dc8AAAAByvWJhg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/labels/cross-file-editing","name":"cross-file-editing","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-11T21:32:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:14:04Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:14:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- Please search existing issues to avoid creating duplicates -->\n<!-- Please attach logs to help us diagnose your issue -->\n\n- Copilot Chat Extension Version: 0.28.2025050901\n- VS Code Version:\n```\nVersion: 1.101.0-insider (user setup)\nCommit: 65fd0a7764119263ab3d5669153ee900ef1844ed\nDate: 2025-05-09T05:04:03.095Z\nElectron: 34.5.1\nElectronBuildId: 11369351\nChromium: 132.0.6834.210\nNode.js: 20.19.0\nV8: 13.2.152.41-electron.0\nOS: Windows_NT x64 10.0.26100\n```\n- OS Version: Windows 11 24H2\n\nHi,\n\nI have seen multiples instances where the Agent will make an edit as instructed, then after editing the file, continue \"Working\", and it will do another edit with another worse fix, then consider it done.\nThe example I will provide is the only one I have saved, but I encountered this before as well. I am unable to say for sure if I had it with other models than Gemini 2.5 Pro (Preview), which is the one used in the example.\n\nChat logs:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec4446b5-c7b9-462f-b157-563072135094)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95791f62-6833-45a8-92b5-5eae239b0037)\n\nFirst fix: \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eca4e8a3-36bf-4ce9-ab23-c084356206b7)\n\nFinal fix: lost due to me manually taking the first one and pasting it, but it was worse\n\nI tried to re-run the prompt a bunch of times, and it did not happen again.\n(I also have a feeling, with no proof, that doing the \"rerun\" button has the model behave differently than when doing a fresh request, let me know if I should investigate)\n\nI tried again with a fresh request and had it happen again:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22cf92d8-b7ef-4ad6-b4f6-a470bb49a280)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f23e722e-a4ef-4125-a167-2a95a1b98780)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1597530f-b6dd-4628-87e7-c5e6292d2932)\n\nOn this run, it modified the file the first edit, and all subsequent edits were just it doing the same thing (no diff number next to the pills)\n\nI am able to provide the code if requested\n\n@isidorn following our reddit convo","closed_by":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/9439/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timel